            "category": "other",
            "text": "This flaw is being rated as 'Moderate' as WebKitGTK package is shipped as a dependency for Gnome package, additionally Red Hat Enterprise Linux doesn't shipped any WebKitGTK based web browser where this flaw would present a higher severity major threat.",
